# Test: an agent reads le's machine reference through a pipe.
# accept-only: the registered native fixture builds the le personality, under
# the names le and ze, and reads le help ai: the text summary naming every
# section and the JSON form; every command's actions and typed parameters as
# JSON; every section as YAML; an unknown section and the --json and --ai
# flags refused with the usage code; and ze le answering the same commands
# under its own program name.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-le-cli-usability AC-38, AC-39, AC-40 and the help ai half of
# AC-48, through the product binary and its real composition root.
option=timeout:value=300s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/le-help-ai
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
